                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Of or relating to nomads.",
                                            "Of or related to itinerant herdsmen."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7b85df8e-e1c5-435a-adfa-a3327070bc92",
                                                "sense_id": "3c65e73e-9f69-3829-b45b-ddb48dd0e47d",
                                                "text": "For centuries, the nomadic tribes of Central Asia used colorful textiles called suzanis as seating, prayer mats, bedding and dividers in their yurts – the traditional tents that were their homes."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b04bebac-104b-3ecb-b63d-dd9e544e48aa",
                                        "entry_id": "c279e6c7-dd45-3554-87fe-3cb2dd9dad22",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Of or relating to nomads.",
                                            "Of or related to any habitually wandering person or animal."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "128d6f60-d69d-4022-9647-ffc8be87b8b6",
                                                "sense_id": "b04bebac-104b-3ecb-b63d-dd9e544e48aa",
                                                "text": "Many of these classic methods are still used, with some modern improvements. For example, with the aid of special microphones and automated sound detection software, ornithologists recently reported […] that pine siskins (Spinus pinus) undergo an irregular, nomadic type of nocturnal migration."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "48e0a2a9-7425-4f38-888c-e4d9f3bd6913",
                                                "sense_id": "b04bebac-104b-3ecb-b63d-dd9e544e48aa",
                                                "text": "Neither vehicle has a set home base. Young explains: \"They are 'nomadic' nationally employed assets that, rather than having a regular home depot, are generally deployed and maintained following a programme of works across the full network."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
